{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04477","headline":"奉和皇帝上礼抚事述怀应制 · 陈子昂","name":"奉和皇帝上礼抚事述怀应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大君忘自我，应运居紫宸。\n揖让期明辟，讴歌且顺人。\n轩宫帝图盛，皇极礼容申。\n南面朝万国，东堂会百神。\n云陛旗常满，天庭玉帛陈。\n钟石和睿思，雷雨被深仁。\n承平信娱乐，王业本艰辛。\n愿罢瑶池宴，来观农扈春。\n卑宫昭夏德，尊老睦尧亲。\n微臣敢拜手，歌舞颂维新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}